{% block content %}

<!-- Brand -->
<span class="brand">The Zero Fog</span>

<!-- Theme toggle -->
<button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" onclick="toggleTheme()">Light</button>

<!-- ===== OPT-IN PAGE ===== -->
<section class="hero" id="hero">

  <p class="pre-headline">Waiting List - Free Training For People Who Work From Home</p>

  <h1 class="headline">The 4-Week Protocol That Removed My Brain Fog And Let Me Do Real Work Again</h1>

  <p class="without-block">(Without Caffeine Hacks, Productivity Apps, or Willpower)</p>

  <p class="sub-headline">Drop your email to be on the list. First in line gets priority access when the training opens.</p>

  <form class="cta-form" id="optinForm">
    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your best email" required autocomplete="email">
    <!-- Honeypot: hidden from real users, bots will fill it -->
    <input type="text" name="website" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
    <input type="hidden" name="source" value="waitlist">
    <button type="submit" class="cta-btn" id="ctaBtn">Join The Waitlist</button>
    <p class="cta-note">Free. We'll email when the training opens. Unsubscribe anytime. <a href="/privacy" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline;">Privacy Policy</a></p>
    <p id="formError" style="color:var(--error);font-size:0.8rem;margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em;"></p>
  </form>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="bullets-section">
    <p class="bullets-heading">Inside The Free Training, You'll Discover:</p>

    <div class="bullet">
      <span class="bullet-check">&#10003;</span>
      <p class="bullet-text">Why you hit a wall by 2 PM every day - and why it has nothing to do with discipline, motivation, or how hard you push yourself</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bullet">
      <span class="bullet-check">&#10003;</span>
      <p class="bullet-text">How I got my focus and energy back without changing my schedule, giving up coffee, or adding anything complicated to my day</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bullet">
      <span class="bullet-check">&#10003;</span>
      <p class="bullet-text">How this works even if you've already tried morning routines, productivity apps, and every "hack" the internet recommended - and why none of that ever stuck</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="disclaimer">This is an educational wellness program, not medical treatment. Results vary.</p>

</section>

